{"step_index":80,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T14:49:09Z","thinking":"**Examining Candidate Conjecture**\n\nThe task involves assessing a conjecture about the total domination number of a graph. The code defines `Candidate` as a proposition. Further analysis will be needed to understand this `Candidate` proposition. This requires understanding the context within `Mathlib` and `LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable` to interpret the conjecture correctly.\n\n\n**Proving the Candidate Theorem**\n\nThe `Candidate` theorem states that a non-trivial graph with a total domination number has a total domination number greater or equal than 2. The provided proof structure is used to instantiate the theorem.  The goal is to show the `Candidate` proposition holds.\n```lean\ntheorem prove_9e476a83 : Candidate := by\n  intro V _ _ G _ hnt hhas\n  exact totalDominationNumber_ge_two G hnt hhas\n```\n\n\n**Refining the Proof Strategy**\n\nThe existing `sorry` in the proof needs replacement by an actual argument. The plan involves proving the theorem directly. The conditions in the `Candidate` proposition require leveraging the non-triviality and total domination properties. The proof should instantiate the theorem with the desired conditions.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Implement prove_9e476a83 with helper lemmas\"","EndLine":"17","Instruction":"\"Replace theorem prove_9e476a83 with complete proof and helper lemmas\"","ReplacementContent":"\"theorem card_ge_two_of_totalDominatingSet {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj]\\n    (hnt : GraphCalc.IsNontrivialClass G)\\n    (s : Finset V) (hs : GraphCalc.IsTotalDominatingSet G s) :\\n    2 ≤ s.card := by\\n  by_contra h\\n  interval_cases hc : s.card\\n  · rw [Finset.card_eq_zero] at hc\\n    subst hc\\n    have hcard : 2 ≤ Fintype.card V := hnt\\n    have : Nonempty V := Fintype.card_pos_iff.mp (by omega)\\n    rcases this with ⟨v⟩\\n    rcases hs v with ⟨u, hu, _⟩\\n    exact Finset.notMem_empty u hu\\n  · rcases Finset.card_eq_one.mp hc with ⟨x, rfl⟩\\n    rcases hs x with ⟨u, hu, hadj⟩\\n    simp only [Finset.mem_singleton] at hu\\n    subst hu\\n    exact G.irrefl hadj\\n\\ntheorem totalDominationNumber_ge_two {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj]\\n    (hnt : GraphCalc.IsNontrivialClass G)\\n    (hhas : GraphCalc.HasTotalDominationNumber G) :\\n    2 ≤ GraphCalc.totalDominationNumber G := by\\n  unfold GraphCalc.totalDominationNumber GraphCalc.minCard\\n  rcases hhas with ⟨s₀, hs₀_pow, hs₀_dom⟩\\n  have hmem : s₀ ∈ Finset.filter (GraphCalc.IsTotalDominatingSet G) Finset.univ.powerset := by\\n    rw [Finset.mem_filter]\\n    exact ⟨hs₀_pow, hs₀_dom⟩\\n  have himage : s₀.card ∈ Finset.image Finset.card (Finset.filter (GraphCalc.IsTotalDominatingSet G) Finset.univ.powerset) :=\\n    Finset.mem_image_of_mem Finset.card hmem\\n  rcases Finset.min_of_mem himage with ⟨b, hb⟩\\n  have hb_mem : b ∈ Finset.image Finset.card (Finset.filter (GraphCalc.IsTotalDominatingSet G) Finset.univ.powerset) :=\\n    Finset.mem_of_min hb\\n  rcases Finset.mem_image.mp hb_mem with ⟨s, hs_filt, hsb⟩\\n  rw [Finset.mem_filter] at hs_filt\\n  have hge2 : 2 ≤ s.card := card_ge_two_of_totalDominatingSet G hnt s hs_filt.2\\n  have hget : ((Finset.image Finset.card (Finset.filter (GraphCalc.IsTotalDominatingSet G) Finset.univ.powerset)).min).getD 0 = b := by\\n    rw [hb]\\n    rfl\\n  rw [hget]\\n  rw [← hsb]\\n\n<truncated 136 bytes>","StartLine":"15","TargetContent":"\"theorem prove_9e476a83 : Candidate := by\\n  sorry\\n\"","TargetFile":"\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_9e476a83/Challenge_9e476a83.lean\"","toolAction":"\"Editing file\"","toolSummary":"\"Implement prove_9e476a83 in Challenge_9e476a83.lean\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
